<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The Shortcut Cheatsheet displays all available keyboard shortcuts organized by category in a read-only retro-styled dialog."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_folder}>{dgettext("help_features", "Opening")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_features", "Press")}
  <strong>{dgettext("help_features", "Ctrl+Shift+/")}</strong> {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "to toggle the cheatsheet dialog."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_folder}>{dgettext("help_features", "Categories")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Every entry has the action name, its key combination and a short description of what it does. The groups you will see are Navigation, Conference, System and P2P Session Console."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_dialog_cheatsheet}>{dgettext("help_features", "Fixed Bindings")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The shortcuts listed are the same for every user. The cheatsheet only shows them. It does not let you change them."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "An action that has no key combination shows a dash instead of keys."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_close}>{dgettext("help_features", "Closing")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_features", "Press")} <strong>{dgettext("help_features", "Escape")}</strong>, <strong>{dgettext("help_features", "Ctrl+Shift+/")}</strong>{dgettext(
    "help_features",
    ", or click the close button."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_features", "Other Ways to Open It")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Open the Help menu and choose Shortcut Cheatsheet.")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Open the Start menu, then Help, then Shortcut Cheatsheet."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The item is grayed out until you are connected to the chat. The cheatsheet opens as a window titled Keyboard Shortcuts. You can move it, resize it, or minimize it to the taskbar while you practice."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_document_alert}>
  {dgettext("help_features", "What It Does Not List")}
</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Keys that work only inside the chat input are not in the cheatsheet. For example:"
  )}
</p>
<ul>
  <li><kbd>Enter</kbd> {dgettext("help_features", "sends the message.")}</li>
  <li><kbd>Shift+Enter</kbd> {dgettext("help_features", "starts a new line.")}</li>
  <li>
    <kbd>Tab</kbd>
    {dgettext("help_features", "completes a nickname, or picks the selected suggestion.")}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The arrow keys browse what you sent before. The Smart Input topic covers them."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="keyboard-shortcuts">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Keyboard Shortcuts")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-key-bindings">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Key Bindings")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-smart-input">{dgettext("help_features", "Smart Input")}</.help_link>
</p>
